🔥 Forest Fire Detection System

📌 Project Overview

Forest Fire Detection System anedi AI/ML and Computer Vision based project. Ee system forest areas lo fire and smoke ni early stage lo detect cheyadaniki design chesam.

Forest fires valla forests, wildlife, human lives mariyu property ki serious damage jaragachu. Kabatti fire ni early ga detect chesi immediate alert ivvadam ee project main purpose.

System input ga images/video frames ni teesukoni, fire or smoke undho ledo analyze chestundi. Fire detect ayithe user ki Forest Fire Alert display cheyyagaladu.

---

🎯 Objectives

Ee project main objectives:

- 🔥 Forest fire ni early stage lo detect cheyadam
- 💨 Smoke and fire ni identify cheyadam
- 🌡️ Environmental conditions ni monitor cheyadam
- 🚨 Fire detect ayinappudu alert generate cheyadam
- 🌳 Forests and wildlife ni protect cheyadaniki help cheyadam
- 📊 Monitoring information ni web application/dashboard lo display cheyadam
- 🤖 AI/ML techniques use chesi detection ni improve cheyadam

---

⚙️ How the System Works

System workflow:

Input Image / Video
        ↓
Image Preprocessing
        ↓
Fire / Smoke Detection
        ↓
Confidence Evaluation
        ↓
Alert Generation
        ↓
Result Display

Input image/video ni system analyze chestundi. Fire or smoke detect ayithe detection confidence ni evaluate chesi, predefined threshold kanna ekkuva unte Forest Fire Alert generate chestundi.

