✅ Advantages

- 🔥 Early fire detection
- ⚡ Fast response
- 🤖 Automatic detection
- 📹 Real-time monitoring possibility
- 💨 Fire and smoke detection
- 📍 Fire region localization
- 🕐 24/7 monitoring possibility
- 🌳 Large-area monitoring possibility
- 💰 Cost-effective monitoring
- 📈 Scalable system
- 🚨 Automatic alerts

---

⚠️ Limitations

- Dataset quality meeda model performance depend avutundi.
- Small or distant fires detect cheyadam difficult avvachu.
- Fog, rain, darkness and heavy smoke detection accuracy ni affect cheyyachu.
- Sunlight, clouds or red/orange objects valla false positives ravachu.
- Deep-learning model training ki high computational resources/GPU avasaram undachu.
- Camera quality and placement detection performance ni affect chestayi.
- Internet-based monitoring ki network connectivity avasaram undachu.
- AI detection potential fire ni indicate chestundi kani every detection real fire ani guarantee cheyyadu.

